  "thag1.2:1.1": "Upasanto uparato ",
  "thag1.2:1.2": "mantabhāṇī anuddhato ",
  "thag1.2:1.3": "dhunāti pāpake dhamme ",
  "thag1.2:1.4": "dumapattaṃ va māluto 'ti. ",
  "thag1.2:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā Mahākoṭṭhikathero gātham abhāsittha. "
}
